    "Deletes every saved item position and restarts the system's menu bar service, so the layout rebuilds from scratch. Thaw saves a backup first. Use this when items won't return to the menu bar after you rearrange." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Deletes every saved item position and restarts the system's menu bar service, so the layout rebuilds from scratch. Thaw saves a backup first. Use this when items won't return to the menu bar after you rearrange."
          }
