    "Other Copies of %@ Are Running" : {

    },
    "Other built-in items are managed separately, and third-party items can always be hidden.\n\nWhile the Thaw Bar is off, hidden Clock, Control Center and Siri stay pinned to the right side of the layout. You can still switch them between visible and hidden." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
