    "Shows a banner when an app starts using your microphone, naming the app, and another when a camera turns on. macOS doesn't tell anyone which app is using a camera, so that one says only that it's in use. While either is on, %@'s menu lists what's using it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Shows a banner when an app starts using your microphone, naming the app, and another when a camera turns on. macOS doesn't tell anyone which app is using a camera, so that one says only that it's in use. While either is on, %@'s menu lists what's using it."
          }
