    "Swap moves the hidden items onto the menu bar and the shown ones off, each group in its own order, until you swap back. It is a real layout change, so it stays that way through a relaunch. The Swap Bar sits under the menu bar on the display your pointer is on, beside the active profile, the section toggles, and Zen Mode, and never takes focus from the app you are in. Right-click the menu bar, a keyboard shortcut, or a Shortcuts action reach the same swap without it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Swap moves the hidden items onto the menu bar and the shown ones off, each group in its own order, until you swap back. It is a real layout change, so it stays that way through a relaunch. The Swap Bar sits under the menu bar on the display your pointer is on, beside the active profile, the section toggles, and Zen Mode, and never takes focus from the app you are in. Right-click the menu bar, a keyboard shortcut, or a Shortcuts action reach the same swap without it."
          }
        },
