    "Swap trades your shown and hidden items: the hidden ones move onto the bar and the shown ones move off, each group in its own order, until you swap back. It is a real layout change, so it stays that way through a relaunch. The Swap bar sits just under the menu bar on the display your pointer is on, with the swap one click away beside the active profile, the section toggles, and zen mode. It never takes focus from the app you are in. Right-click the menu bar, a hotkey, or a Shortcuts action reach the same swap without it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Swap trades your shown and hidden items: the hidden ones move onto the bar and the shown ones move off, each group in its own order, until you swap back. It is a real layout change, so it stays that way through a relaunch. The Swap bar sits just under the menu bar on the display your pointer is on, with the swap one click away beside the active profile, the section toggles, and zen mode. It never takes focus from the app you are in. Right-click the menu bar, a hotkey, or a Shortcuts action reach the same swap without it."
          }
        },
