    "These hooks run only when this profile is applied, after the global pre-hook and before the global post-hook." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the hooks that run only when a profile is applied.",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tyto hooky se spustí po aktivaci vybraného profilu, po globálním pre-hooku a před globálním post-hookem."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Hooks werden nur ausgeführt, wenn dieses Profil angewendet wird, nach dem globalen Pre-Hook und vor dem globalen Post-Hook."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estos hooks solo se ejecutan cuando se aplica este perfil, después del pre-hook global y antes del post-hook global."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ces hooks ne s’exécutent que lorsque ce profil est appliqué, après le pre-hook global et avant le post-hook global."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ezek a hookok csak akkor futnak le, amikor ezt a profilt alkalmazod, a globális pre-hook után és a globális post-hook előtt."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hook hanya dapat dijalankan ketika profil ini diterapkan, setelah pre-hook global dan sebelum post-hook global."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These hooks run only when this profile is applied, after the global pre-hook and before the global post-hook."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These hooks run only when this profile is applied, after the global pre-hook and before the global post-hook."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 훅은 해당 프로필이 적용되어 있을 때, 전역 사전 훅 이후 그리고 전역 사후 훅 이전에만 실행됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deze hooks worden alleen uitgevoerd wanneer dit profiel wordt toegepast, na de globale pre-hook en vóór de globale post-hook."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Te hooki są uruchamiane wyłącznie w przypadku zastosowania tego profilu, po globalnym pre-hooku, a przed globalnym post-hookiem."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esses hooks são executados apenas quando este perfil é aplicado, após o gancho pré-global e antes do gancho pós-global."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Эти хуки запускаются только при применении данного профиля — после глобального pre-hook и перед глобальным post-hook"
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hooks เหล่านี้จะทำงานเฉพาะเมื่อมีการใช้โปรไฟล์นี้เท่านั้น โดยจะทำงานหลังจาก pre-hook ส่วนกลาง และก่อน post-hook ส่วนกลาง"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu hooklar, yalnızca bu profil uygulandığında, global pre-hook 'dan sonra ve global post-hook 'dan önce çalışır."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These hooks run only when this profile is applied, after the global pre-hook and before the global post-hook."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Các hook này chỉ chạy khi cấu hình này được áp dụng, sau hook pre-hook toàn cục và trước hook post-hook toàn cục."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些 Hook 仅会在应用当前配置时运行，执行顺序位于全局前置 Hook 之后、全局后置 Hook 之前。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些 Hook 僅在套用此設定檔時執行，於全域 pre-hook 之後、全域 post-hook 之前。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
